{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "89ffd20e-8399-8086-a60d-0d25d7cf6df2",
  "created_at": "2026-01-28T18:24:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:20:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Fernando Furtado. I know it's after hours, City Hall's closed, but the recording said this line takes storm calls in the evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:20:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does, you've got the right place. What's going on, Mr. Furtado?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:20:54-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Water. The drain out front of my house is backed up, and it's been like that since the storm last weekend, the snow turning to rain, Sunday into Monday. It's Wednesday now. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:21:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:21:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "324 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. I rent there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:21:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 324 Gibbs. And the drain in front is not taking any water at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:21:25-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's got a pond sitting on top of it. Every car coming through slows to a crawl, they creep through it like it's a river. Some of them come up on the other side of the road to get around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:21:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good, especially in the dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:21:46-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And here's the thing that really gets me. A few inches came into the cellar. Seeped right in along the wall. I've been in this house years, and that has never happened. Never. Not once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:22:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Is it still wet down there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:22:06-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Damp, yeah. I got the wet vac going and moved my boxes up on the shelves. But the water was coming from the street, I'm positive. The drain's choked with something, leaves, slush, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:22:22-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be debris, or it could be frozen up from the cold snap. Either way, a crew has to look at it. Let me get this down. Is the drain right at the curb, in front of your house, or at the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:22:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the curb, in front. Little bit toward the corner but it's mine, it's by my walkway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm putting it in as a blocked storm drain with water in the roadway and a basement affected. Can I have a good number in case somebody needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:23:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0150. That's the landline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:23:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0150, perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:23:08-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Now, do the crews work weekends? Because I'm not waiting till Monday with that sitting there. If it freezes tonight, forget it, it's a skating rink."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:23:20-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They do cover weekends when there's weather or a hazard, and standing water that could ice over gets flagged as a priority. This will go on tomorrow morning's list with the note about the road and your cellar."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:23:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tomorrow morning. Okay. That's better than what I was afraid of. I just, it's been two days, you know? Somebody should've been by."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. After a storm like that, a lot of drains went at once, and the calls pile up. But yours is in now, and it's got the details."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:24:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I gotta go, I'm calling right before I pick up the kids, they're waiting on me. I just wanted this on record tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:24:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's on record. If it ices before the crew gets there, call this line back and tell whoever answers it's already logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:24:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T18:24:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Furtado. Drive safe getting the kids."
    }
  ],
